id: pm-ervmsc
title: Agent-task closeout claims lack linked full-verification commands
description: "CodeRabbit review on PR #1133 found that pm-8pnj completion comments name exact full coverage, packed npx, packed bunx, and 88-command dogfood evidence while its linked tests record only focused transcript and release commands. Add runnable PM-linked commands and test-run receipts for reproducible claims; document the evidence-before-close ordering lesson without rewriting append-only history."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: "area:governance",evidence,review-feedback,testing
created_at: "2026-08-27T19:11:55.197Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-27T22:10:54.315Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-27T22:10:53.657Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-27T22:10:53.657Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "Coverage, npx package smoke, bunx packed acceptance, and dogfood claims have runnable linked PM tests or are corrected; executed test-run receipts are recorded; append-only history is not rewritten; future evidence is recorded before close and release"
parent: pm-8pnj
resolution: Appended reproducible feature evidence without rewriting history and established evidence-before-close ordering for all new review findings.
expected_result: Every broad closeout claim is reproducible from linked PM commands and append-only evidence preserves lifecycle ordering.
actual_result: "pm-8pnj now links and records passing exact coverage, npx package smoke, 88-command package-first dogfood, and packed bunx acceptance alongside its focused gates."
